urrent code and interface rather than treating the proposal as current behavior.',remaining=['Construct a legal partition/election discriminator for nonvoter-assisted verification and establish its precise public-contract applicability.','Retain bounded-append and post-truncation failure questions as independent sourced surfaces.'],understanding='updated',rationale='Core understanding is now recorded; source differences guide selection but do not constitute execution evidence.'))\nopen('submission.json','w').write(json.dumps(S,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\npython3 build_map.py\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-03_16-48-46-hashicorp_raft-real-run --submission submission.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
